docs {
  Adds a link to a resources space. The answer comes at once with capture_status "pending": a queued job captures the page (ADR 0018) and the space channel sends community.resource.updated at each change (capturing, then captured or failed). Without a name, the title of the page becomes the name after the capture.
}
